{"module":"afro-latino","voice":"male","duration":298.0,"segments":[{"el":"title","text":"La diáspora africana en América Latina y el Caribe","start":0.0,"end":3.45,"words":[[0.0,0.16],[0.16,0.82],[0.82,1.48],[1.48,1.64],[1.64,2.22],[2.22,2.71],[2.71,2.79],[2.79,2.96],[2.96,3.45]]},{"el":"intro","text":"EE. UU. recibió solo una pequeña parte de los africanos llevados a través del Atlántico.","start":4.25,"end":10.37,"words":[[4.27,4.48],[4.83,5.04],[5.39,5.88],[5.88,6.16],[6.16,6.37],[6.37,6.79],[6.79,7.14],[7.14,7.28],[7.28,7.49],[7.49,8.12],[8.12,8.61],[8.61,8.68],[8.68,9.1],[9.1,9.31],[9.31,10.01]]},{"el":"intro","text":"La mayoría fue a Brasil y al Caribe, y sus descendientes viven en todo el continente, incluidos millones de afrolatinos en Estados Unidos.","start":10.72,"end":20.65,"words":[[10.75,10.9],[10.9,11.51],[11.51,11.74],[11.74,11.82],[11.82,12.28],[12.28,12.36],[12.36,12.51],[12.51,13.05],[13.32,13.4],[13.4,13.63],[13.63,14.55],[14.55,14.93],[14.93,15.08],[15.08,15.39],[15.39,15.55],[15.55,16.39],[16.66,17.35],[17.35,17.96],[17.96,18.12],[18.12,18.96],[18.96,19.12],[19.12,19.65],[19.65,20.19]]},{"el":"intro","text":"Allí el racismo tomó otras formas, pero no fue menos real.","start":21.0,"end":25.14,"words":[[21.03,21.32],[21.32,21.46],[21.46,21.95],[21.95,22.24],[22.24,22.59],[22.59,23.08],[23.33,23.61],[23.61,23.75],[23.75,23.97],[23.97,24.32],[24.32,24.67]]},{"el":"h0","text":"Adónde iban los barcos","start":25.49,"end":27.39,"words":[[25.53,26.06],[26.06,26.42],[26.42,26.69],[26.69,27.22]]},{"el":"s0","text":"De los cerca de 10.7 millones de africanos que sobrevivieron a la travesía del Atlántico, unos 388,000 fueron llevados directamente a Norteamérica continental.","start":28.09,"end":41.48,"words":[[28.12,28.26],[28.26,28.47],[28.47,28.82],[28.82,28.96],[28.96,29.94],[29.94,30.5],[30.5,30.64],[30.64,31.28],[31.28,31.42],[31.42,32.33],[32.33,32.4],[32.4,32.54],[32.54,33.17],[33.17,33.38],[33.38,34.08],[34.32,34.6],[34.6,37.41],[37.41,37.83],[37.83,38.32],[38.32,39.16],[39.16,39.23],[39.23,40.07],[40.07,40.91]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Unos 4.9 millones fueron llevados a Brasil, y la mayoría del resto al Caribe y a la América española (SlaveVoyages.org).","start":41.83,"end":50.8,"words":[[41.86,42.14],[42.14,43.29],[43.29,43.86],[43.86,44.29],[44.29,44.8],[44.8,44.87],[44.87,45.37],[45.62,45.69],[45.69,45.83],[45.83,46.41],[46.41,46.62],[46.62,46.98],[46.98,47.12],[47.12,47.55],[47.55,47.63],[47.63,47.7],[47.7,47.84],[47.84,48.34],[48.34,48.92],[48.92,50.42]]},{"el":"h1","text":"Haití y la República Dominicana","start":51.7,"end":54.67,"words":[[51.74,52.18],[52.18,52.29],[52.29,52.5],[52.5,53.48],[53.48,54.57]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Haití ganó su independencia en 1804 y fue castigado por ello (ver “Antes de la raza”).","start":55.37,"end":62.09,"words":[[55.41,55.71],[55.71,56.01],[56.01,56.16],[56.16,57.12],[57.12,57.27],[57.27,58.75],[58.75,58.83],[58.83,59.05],[59.05,59.72],[59.72,59.94],[59.94,60.24],[60.24,60.46],[60.46,60.83],[60.83,60.98],[60.98,61.13],[61.13,61.5]]},{"el":"s1","text":"En octubre de 1937, el dictador dominicano Rafael Trujillo ordenó a sus soldados matar a haitianos y a dominicanos de ascendencia haitiana en la zona fronteriza; las estimaciones de muertos van de unos 12,000 a 30,000.","start":62.44,"end":79.66,"words":[[62.46,62.59],[62.59,63.08],[63.08,63.22],[63.22,65.18],[65.42,65.56],[65.56,66.12],[66.12,66.82],[66.82,67.23],[67.23,67.79],[67.79,68.21],[68.21,68.28],[68.28,68.49],[68.49,69.05],[69.05,69.4],[69.4,69.47],[69.47,70.02],[70.02,70.09],[70.09,70.16],[70.16,70.93],[70.93,71.07],[71.07,71.77],[71.77,72.26],[72.26,72.4],[72.4,72.54],[72.54,72.81],[72.81,73.58],[73.83,74.04],[74.04,74.87],[74.87,75.01],[75.01,75.5],[75.5,75.71],[75.71,75.85],[75.85,76.13],[76.13,77.52],[77.52,77.59],[77.59,79.27]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Se recuerda como la masacre del Perejil.","start":80.01,"end":83.1,"words":[[80.05,80.19],[80.19,80.75],[80.75,81.03],[81.03,81.17],[81.17,81.66],[81.66,81.87],[81.87,82.43]]},{"el":"s1","text":"En 2013, el Tribunal Constitucional dominicano dictaminó que los hijos de padres extranjeros indocumentados nacidos en el país desde 1929 no eran ciudadanos, lo que dejó sin nacionalidad a decenas de miles de dominicanos de ascendencia haitiana.","start":83.45,"end":100.81,"words":[[83.48,83.62],[83.62,84.46],[84.71,84.85],[84.85,85.41],[85.41,86.39],[86.39,87.09],[87.09,87.72],[87.72,87.86],[87.86,88.07],[88.07,88.35],[88.35,88.49],[88.49,88.91],[88.91,89.76],[89.76,90.74],[90.74,91.23],[91.23,91.37],[91.37,91.51],[91.51,91.79],[91.79,92.14],[92.14,93.89],[93.89,94.03],[94.03,94.31],[94.31,95.08],[95.33,95.47],[95.47,95.61],[95.61,95.89],[95.89,96.1],[96.1,96.94],[96.94,97.01],[97.01,97.5],[97.5,97.64],[97.64,97.99],[97.99,98.13],[98.13,98.9],[98.9,99.04],[99.04,99.74],[99.74,100.3]]},{"el":"h2","text":"Cuba y Puerto Rico","start":101.71,"end":103.47,"words":[[101.75,102.18],[102.18,102.29],[102.29,102.93],[102.93,103.36]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Veteranos afrocubanos de la guerra de independencia fundaron el Partido Independiente de Color en 1908.","start":104.17,"end":111.91,"words":[[104.17,104.83],[104.83,105.63],[105.63,105.78],[105.78,105.93],[105.93,106.22],[106.22,106.36],[106.36,107.31],[107.31,107.89],[107.89,108.04],[108.04,108.55],[108.55,109.5],[109.5,109.65],[109.65,110.01],[110.01,110.16],[110.16,111.54]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Cuba prohibió en 1910 los partidos organizados por raza, y en 1912 el ejército aplastó la protesta del partido, matando a entre 2,000 y 6,000 afrocubanos, según las estimaciones.","start":112.26,"end":128.27,"words":[[112.29,112.57],[112.57,113.08],[113.08,113.22],[113.22,114.51],[114.51,114.72],[114.72,115.3],[115.3,116.09],[116.09,116.3],[116.3,116.66],[116.91,116.98],[116.98,117.12],[117.12,118.41],[118.41,118.56],[118.56,119.13],[119.13,119.63],[119.63,119.78],[119.78,120.35],[120.35,120.56],[120.56,121.14],[121.39,121.89],[121.89,121.96],[121.96,122.32],[122.32,123.68],[123.68,123.75],[123.75,125.19],[125.19,126.05],[126.3,126.66],[126.66,126.87],[126.87,127.8]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Puerto Rico abolió la esclavitud en 1873.","start":128.62,"end":133.31,"words":[[128.64,129.09],[129.09,129.39],[129.39,129.84],[129.84,129.99],[129.99,130.74],[130.74,130.89],[130.89,132.91]]},{"el":"s2","text":"El puertorriqueño Arturo Schomburg dedicó su vida a reunir libros y documentos de historia negra; su colección es el núcleo del Centro Schomburg para la Investigación de la Cultura Negra de la Biblioteca Pública de Nueva York.","start":133.66,"end":147.95,"words":[[133.66,133.8],[133.8,134.67],[134.67,135.1],[135.1,135.75],[135.75,136.18],[136.18,136.32],[136.32,136.61],[136.61,136.68],[136.68,137.12],[137.12,137.55],[137.55,137.62],[137.62,138.34],[138.34,138.48],[138.48,138.99],[138.99,139.42],[139.67,139.82],[139.82,140.47],[140.47,140.61],[140.61,140.75],[140.75,141.19],[141.19,141.4],[141.4,141.84],[141.84,142.48],[142.48,142.77],[142.77,142.92],[142.92,143.85],[143.85,144.0],[144.0,144.14],[144.14,144.65],[144.65,145.01],[145.01,145.15],[145.15,145.29],[145.29,146.09],[146.09,146.59],[146.59,146.73],[146.73,147.09],[147.09,147.45]]},{"el":"h3","text":"México y Centroamérica","start":148.85,"end":151.11,"words":[[148.85,149.45],[149.45,149.55],[149.55,150.84]]},{"el":"s3","text":"A principios del siglo XVII, Gaspar Yanga encabezó una comunidad de personas que habían escapado de la esclavitud cerca de Veracruz y resistió a las tropas españolas; España aceptó reconocer un pueblo libre, que hoy se llama Yanga.","start":151.81,"end":167.59,"words":[[151.84,151.92],[151.92,152.66],[152.66,152.88],[152.88,153.25],[153.25,154.07],[154.33,154.77],[154.77,155.15],[155.15,155.74],[155.74,155.96],[155.96,156.63],[156.63,156.78],[156.78,157.37],[157.37,157.52],[157.52,157.97],[157.97,158.56],[158.56,158.71],[158.71,158.86],[158.86,159.6],[159.6,159.97],[159.97,160.12],[160.12,160.71],[160.71,160.78],[160.78,161.38],[161.38,161.45],[161.45,161.68],[161.68,162.12],[162.12,162.86],[163.12,163.57],[163.57,164.01],[164.01,164.68],[164.68,164.83],[164.83,165.27],[165.27,165.72],[165.98,166.13],[166.13,166.28],[166.28,166.42],[166.42,166.72],[166.72,167.17]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Vicente Guerrero, un presidente de ascendencia africana e indígena, abolió la esclavitud en México en 1829, y miles de personas esclavizadas en Texas y el sur de EE. UU. huyeron hacia el sur en busca de libertad.","start":167.94,"end":184.86,"words":[[167.95,168.49],[168.49,169.02],[169.29,169.44],[169.44,170.21],[170.21,170.36],[170.36,171.12],[171.12,171.73],[171.73,171.81],[171.81,172.5],[172.77,173.23],[173.23,173.38],[173.38,174.14],[174.14,174.3],[174.3,174.75],[174.75,174.91],[174.91,176.89],[177.16,177.24],[177.24,177.62],[177.62,177.77],[177.77,178.39],[178.39,179.3],[179.3,179.46],[179.46,179.91],[179.91,179.99],[179.99,180.14],[180.14,180.37],[180.37,180.53],[180.53,180.75],[181.14,181.37],[181.75,182.21],[182.21,182.51],[182.51,182.67],[182.67,182.9],[182.9,183.05],[183.05,183.43],[183.43,183.58],[183.58,184.27]]},{"el":"s3","text":"México contó por primera vez a su población afromexicana en 2015 (cerca de 1.4 millones de personas) y la reconoció en la constitución en 2019.","start":185.21,"end":196.55,"words":[[185.23,185.66],[185.66,186.02],[186.02,186.24],[186.24,186.75],[186.75,186.96],[186.96,187.04],[187.04,187.18],[187.18,187.83],[187.83,188.7],[188.7,188.85],[188.85,189.64],[189.64,190.0],[190.0,190.15],[190.15,191.16],[191.16,191.74],[191.74,191.89],[191.89,192.46],[192.72,192.79],[192.79,192.93],[192.93,193.59],[193.59,193.73],[193.73,193.88],[193.88,194.74],[194.74,194.89],[194.89,196.12]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Los garífunas, descendientes de africanos e indígenas caribeños, viven en las costas de Honduras, Belice, Guatemala y Nicaragua.","start":196.9,"end":206.21,"words":[[196.92,197.14],[197.14,197.86],[198.11,198.98],[198.98,199.12],[199.12,199.77],[199.77,199.84],[199.84,200.49],[200.49,201.21],[201.47,201.83],[201.83,201.97],[201.97,202.19],[202.19,202.62],[202.62,202.77],[202.77,203.34],[203.6,204.1],[204.35,205.0],[205.0,205.08],[205.08,205.8]]},{"el":"h4","text":"Brasil y el mito de la “democracia racial”","start":207.11,"end":210.03,"words":[[207.14,207.66],[207.66,207.75],[207.75,207.92],[207.92,208.27],[208.27,208.44],[208.44,208.62],[208.62,209.48],[209.48,210.0]]},{"el":"s4","text":"En la década de 1930, el sociólogo Gilberto Freyre popularizó la idea de que Brasil, a diferencia de EE. UU., era una “democracia racial” donde el mestizaje había borrado el racismo.","start":210.73,"end":224.51,"words":[[210.76,210.9],[210.9,211.05],[211.05,211.5],[211.5,211.65],[211.65,213.29],[213.55,213.7],[213.7,214.37],[214.37,214.97],[214.97,215.42],[215.42,216.16],[216.16,216.31],[216.31,216.61],[216.61,216.76],[216.76,216.91],[216.91,217.43],[217.69,217.76],[217.76,218.51],[218.51,218.66],[218.66,218.88],[219.26,219.48],[219.74,219.96],[219.96,220.19],[220.19,220.93],[220.93,221.38],[221.38,221.75],[221.75,221.9],[221.9,222.57],[222.57,222.95],[222.95,223.4],[223.4,223.54],[223.54,224.14]]},{"el":"s4","text":"El registro lo contradice.","start":224.86,"end":226.89,"words":[[224.88,225.01],[225.01,225.53],[225.53,225.66],[225.66,226.38]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Brasil fue el último país de América en abolir la esclavitud (1888), y después el gobierno subsidió la inmigración europea en un esfuerzo deliberado por “blanquear” la población.","start":227.24,"end":240.22,"words":[[227.26,227.7],[227.7,227.91],[227.91,228.06],[228.06,228.5],[228.5,228.79],[228.79,228.93],[228.93,229.45],[229.45,229.59],[229.59,230.03],[230.03,230.17],[230.17,230.9],[230.9,232.94],[233.2,233.27],[233.27,233.78],[233.78,233.93],[233.93,234.51],[234.51,235.1],[235.1,235.24],[235.24,236.04],[236.04,236.55],[236.55,236.7],[236.7,236.84],[236.84,237.43],[237.43,238.16],[238.16,238.38],[238.38,238.96],[238.96,239.1],[239.1,239.83]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Hoy la mayoría de los brasileños se identifica como negra o parda, pero siguen siendo mucho más pobres y mucho más propensos a morir a manos de la policía.","start":240.57,"end":250.68,"words":[[240.59,240.74],[240.74,240.89],[240.89,241.48],[241.48,241.63],[241.63,241.85],[241.85,242.6],[242.6,242.75],[242.75,243.49],[243.49,243.79],[243.79,244.16],[244.16,244.24],[244.24,244.68],[244.94,245.24],[245.24,245.61],[245.61,246.06],[246.06,246.43],[246.43,246.66],[246.66,247.1],[247.1,247.18],[247.18,247.55],[247.55,247.77],[247.77,248.44],[248.44,248.52],[248.52,248.89],[248.89,248.96],[248.96,249.33],[249.33,249.48],[249.48,249.63],[249.63,250.3]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Brasil adoptó cuotas raciales en sus universidades federales en 2012.","start":251.03,"end":256.03,"words":[[251.05,251.47],[251.47,251.89],[251.89,252.31],[252.31,252.88],[252.88,253.02],[253.02,253.23],[253.23,254.14],[254.14,254.77],[254.77,254.91],[254.91,255.69]]},{"el":"h5","text":"Afrolatinos en Estados Unidos","start":256.93,"end":259.4,"words":[[256.95,257.93],[257.93,258.11],[258.11,258.73],[258.73,259.26]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Una encuesta de 2022 del Pew Research Center encontró que cerca del 12% de los adultos latinos en EE. UU., unos 6 millones de personas, se identifican como afrolatinos.","start":260.1,"end":273.26,"words":[[260.16,260.37],[260.37,260.96],[260.96,261.1],[261.1,262.19],[262.19,262.41],[262.41,262.63],[262.63,263.21],[263.21,263.65],[263.65,264.23],[264.23,264.37],[264.37,264.74],[264.74,264.96],[264.96,265.9],[265.9,266.05],[266.05,266.27],[266.27,266.77],[266.77,267.28],[267.28,267.43],[267.43,267.65],[268.01,268.23],[268.48,268.77],[268.77,269.07],[269.07,269.65],[269.65,269.79],[269.79,270.45],[270.7,270.85],[270.85,271.65],[271.65,271.94],[271.94,272.81]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Muchos reportan discriminación tanto por ser negros como por ser latinos, incluso por parte de otros latinos.","start":273.61,"end":280.82,"words":[[273.61,274.04],[274.04,274.61],[274.61,275.6],[275.6,275.96],[275.96,276.17],[276.17,276.38],[276.38,276.81],[276.81,277.09],[277.09,277.31],[277.31,277.52],[277.52,278.09],[278.34,278.83],[278.83,279.05],[279.05,279.4],[279.4,279.55],[279.55,279.9],[279.9,280.47]]},{"el":"s5","text":"El colorismo, la preferencia por la piel más clara dentro de una comunidad, forma parte de esta historia en todo el continente.","start":281.17,"end":289.12,"words":[[281.18,281.32],[281.32,282.0],[282.23,282.37],[282.37,283.12],[283.12,283.32],[283.32,283.45],[283.45,283.73],[283.73,283.93],[283.93,284.27],[284.27,284.68],[284.68,284.81],[284.81,285.02],[285.02,285.69],[285.93,286.27],[286.27,286.61],[286.61,286.75],[286.75,287.02],[287.02,287.49],[287.49,287.63],[287.63,287.9],[287.9,288.04],[288.04,288.78]]},{"el":"s5","text":"La Ley CAREN protege a cualquier persona denunciada a la policía por su raza, color, ascendencia u origen nacional.","start":289.47,"end":297.09,"words":[[289.49,289.63],[289.63,289.84],[289.84,290.19],[290.19,290.68],[290.68,290.75],[290.75,291.31],[291.31,291.8],[291.8,292.49],[292.49,292.56],[292.56,292.7],[292.7,293.26],[293.26,293.47],[293.47,293.61],[293.61,293.96],[294.2,294.62],[294.86,295.56],[295.56,295.63],[295.63,296.05],[296.05,296.68]]}]}